{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8e0e1220-bfb5-8687-b30c-62e4bc0b063f",
  "created_at": "2025-12-09T11:51:41-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ana Pacheco",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:49:12-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:49:16-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, good morning. My name is Ana Pacheco. I am calling about a storm drain. I am property manager, and the drain is at the corner by building I manage."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:49:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:49:30-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 373 Eustis Avenue, on Historic Hill. The drain is on the corner there. [line breaks up] ...is full to the top, and it is not draining at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:49:41-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You broke up a little on me. You said it's full to the top and not draining?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:49:48-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly. Full to the top. Water just sits. This is from the nor'easter that ended Saturday, three days ago. Three days, and it is still like this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:49:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is the water in the street, or up on the sidewalk too?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:50:03-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The sidewalk is a sheet of mud and grit. Everything washed down and stayed. I am worried somebody will slip, and also the water will go toward the entrance. [inaudible] I have tenants walking there every day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:50:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. That sounds like debris clogging the grate or the pipe. I can put that in for the drain crew."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:50:23-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Will a work order be opened? And for what date? I would like to know when somebody comes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:50:30-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I'll open one right now while we're talking. Crews are working through a pile of these after the storm, so I'd say it's likely sometime this week, but I can't promise a day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:50:42-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "This week. Okay. Sorry, one moment, the signal is bad here. I am standing outside because I stopped to charge my car. I switched to electric car this year, so now I am always planning charging stops. [crosstalk]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:50:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Do you want to keep your signal, or should I grab a number in case we drop?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:51:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. Number is four zero one, five five five, zero one eight one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:51:08-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-one. Got it. And you're the manager, so the crew can call you if they need to get at it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:51:16-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, call me. I can meet them there. Please tell them the drain is on the corner, not in the middle of the block."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:51:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Corner of 373 Eustis, full and not draining, mud on the sidewalk. It's in the system."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:51:31-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you very much. I appreciate it. I will watch the drain and call again if the water rises."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-09T11:51:38-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good. Take care, Ms. Pacheco."
    }
  ],
